<block><txt break.before="1">An Act to facilitate the establishment and
operation of a kraft pulp and paper mill in southern New South Wales by Visy
Industries Holdings Pty Limited.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="part" id="pt.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f1a907b6-a544-4fe4-aca4-ee75e4839e97"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 1</b></no><heading guid="_f4043797-e86f-4ae8-b4a1-e8825f34b4ca"
id="pt.1-he"><b>Preliminary</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8542695e-b992-49d8-88b5-5982e08410f7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_33889d1c-4e05-4bdc-9011-b735807df3aa"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act is the <legref refid="act-1997-139"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Visy Mill
Facilitation Act 1997</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_04a36fc4-087e-4fde-809a-c6adbf8d6500"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_57284c79-8e5b-4fb4-9119-e10e7ed661db"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on a day or days to be
appointed by proclamation.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_be485fa3-0165-4928-9b5b-abdad5a6480c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_f4aba071-0470-444a-8fd0-0c732e036b68"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Interpretation</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3e20cda7-77e0-44e8-b545-e71be7a8430e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_f788c064-b887-495c-90cd-3bbdd9713c56"
id="sec.3-def.Agreement"><b><i>Agreement</i></b></defterm> means the timber
supply agreement or proposed timber supply agreement between the Commission
and the Company relating to the supply of timber to the Company in connection
with a kraft pulp and paper mill at or near Tumut, and includes any agreement
amending or replacing that agreement.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_3684aa32-0974-4061-acc4-82ebce78eb77"
id="sec.3-def.Commission"><b><i>Commission</i></b></defterm> means the
Forestry Commission of New South Wales, which trades as State
Forests.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_6f6179db-b9c7-49d6-8591-aa5ef6e75bb1"
id="sec.3-def.Company"><b><i>Company</i></b></defterm> means Visy Industries
Holdings Pty Limited (ACN 005 787 968), and includes any successors to or
assignees of that company.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_1088cc2b-4ae2-41b2-a91b-6b057f35cef6"
id="sec.3-def.designatedactivities"><b><i>designated
activities</i></b></defterm> means any activities or proposed activities to
which the Agreement relates or that are declared to be designated activities
in an order under subsection (2).</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_4d3f7e7d-4cb8-465e-bf91-c36d0159e2e9"
id="sec.3-def.externalevent"><b><i>external event</i></b></defterm> means an
event, act, omission or state of affairs that occurs outside the control of
the Commission, and includes any decision, direction or other act of the State
or of an agency of the State (other than the Commission), and also includes
the enactment of an Act or the making of a statutory rule under an
Act.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_fd5df423-6270-490f-ae2f-e489edaf734f"
id="sec.3-def.State"><b><i>State</i></b></defterm> includes the Crown in right
of New South Wales and the Government of New South
Wales.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2d9e1368-5f86-439c-bcc2-356f4ebd17e1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may, by order published in the
Gazette, declare any activities (or proposed activities) connected with the
Agreement, or with the kraft pulp and paper mill (or the proposed kraft pulp
and paper mill) to which the Agreement relates, to be designated activities
for the purposes of this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3c7e1c74-073d-474f-a240-2813d2ffdaf7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Forestry Corporation constituted under the
<legref refid="act-2012-096" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Forestry Act 2012</i></name></legref> is taken to be an
agency of the State for the purposes of this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3:</b> Am 2012 No 96,
Sch 4.49.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_63f073bc-acae-40c4-adcd-f51d3221a03e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_d5431d3c-c82a-41bb-97cd-424895580ee5"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Purpose of Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_10f58b2e-8ad7-415f-9198-0f1807277d0c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The principal purpose of this Act is facilitate
the establishment and operation of a kraft pulp and paper mill in southern New
South Wales by the Company.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9806d968-b245-445b-bb50-560670d8eb66"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">It is the intention of Parliament that the State
and its agencies will act to promote the principal purpose of this Act, and in
particular will use their best endeavours:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_21fd87d5-d105-4776-823c-454f829eaa26" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to assist the Company and any other persons to
obtain any approvals that are necessary for or relevant to any of the
designated activities, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_03ab5f10-de3c-489f-8218-ab1237a0900d" id="sec.4-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to ensure that, within the applicable legislative
structures, any such approvals will be granted.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cc6f31f5-d1f1-479a-9ef1-9a975d589865"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_4df04006-bc01-44d9-a8a5-21567712c649"
id="sec.4-def.approval"><b><i>approval</i></b></defterm> means a consent,
licence, permit, permission or any form of authorisation.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_35b3ce60-ce6c-4548-a9cd-41a94b9d2187"
id="sec.4-def.grant"><b><i>grant</i></b></defterm> an approval includes give
or issue an approval.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5e749f9f-e68f-41ed-a01e-136743e04316"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_b251ae21-58e0-4e2e-a2f6-e1975e0332ff"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Act to bind Crown</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown in right of New South
Wales and, in so far as the legislative power of the Parliament of New South
Wales permits, the Crown in all its other capacities.</txt></block></level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_67089879-3880-44d6-a25f-1b493fc0aa5d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_19e1426e-fa65-43cd-a551-7da9039fe9c9"
id="pt.2-he"><b>The Agreement</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d8544efe-7dd5-49eb-9440-3d1222676eb1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_67daaf8f-9415-4b3d-baac-9a2ffb7fb18b"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Term of timber licences</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_53865154-024d-4159-9737-571417bb7b3c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Agreement may be entered into by the
Commission despite anything in section 27A (2) of the <legref
refid="act-1916-055" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Forestry Act 1916</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d6fb6578-0bb5-4c4d-98e7-8bea6e5d8ee5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Agreement may provide that section 27A (2) of
the <legref refid="act-1916-055" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Forestry Act 1916</i></name></legref> does not apply to any
timber licences issued or to be issued to the Company. Such a provision has
effect according to its tenor.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_46236703-14ed-4d76-bf40-125a25c59bb9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_0ddaedc2-97c8-4007-8eca-13797ec47df0"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Amendment of Agreement</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_31f4dcc8-db49-410a-b06a-11be31d055c0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Agreement may be amended only by agreement
between the Commission, with the approval of the Minister, and the
Company.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f69212b9-c53a-457f-8b28-0cf6435ede6f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If the Commission is dissolved, or functions of
the Commission are transferred or devolve as referred to in section 11, the
reference in subsection (1) of this section to the Commission is to be read as
a reference to:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_22efc8a5-1fc5-48a9-816a-e1036b6f9baf" id="sec.7-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">an agency of the State specified by the Minister
by order published in the Gazette, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4a838d07-0046-404f-be6b-9194644e8475" id="sec.7-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">(with the consent of the Company) another body or
person so specified.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_12168f8d-5fa9-4a93-941e-5e69eb60d48b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_9a7325e7-1007-4a17-b2a8-14554ef98a1c"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Certain events not to cause or permit termination of
Agreement</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_dcdd6683-eeb5-43f3-b006-b6aeeb7209d6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Agreement may contain provisions to the
effect that it is neither terminated by, nor terminable by reference to,
external events specified or described in the Agreement. Such a provision has
effect according to its tenor.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4df10f1c-0f67-4627-9352-6e5f1907ba83"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Agreement may (but need not) limit the
operation of such a provision.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_55c121b7-76b4-4d4b-9b4e-e05c7a861fda"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading guid="_5e2ee512-f92f-4d73-b1ed-3f4506797ec2"
id="pt.3-he"><b>Guarantees and undertakings</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2418b061-652b-40d9-af01-8e2bfb226677"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_df38e5c7-ad4d-465e-a34f-599a879b2bee"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Guarantees</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_62868f95-e36d-40c0-954d-56865d6fbb1c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The State may guarantee the due performance by
the Commission of any obligations or liabilities incurred by the Commission
under the Agreement.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b8726efb-e2e2-4e88-9823-191810ec56d9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The form of such a guarantee (including its terms
and conditions) is to be as determined by the Treasurer.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_41b5770b-516d-4476-9304-cee3fd0ac109"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The State may, in relation to any matters arising
under or in connection with the Agreement, agree to make a payment to the
Company pursuant to such a guarantee even though the Commission may be
precluded by the law of New South Wales from making such a
payment.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_790c07ea-039f-4345-b7f2-4a80f6124441"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Treasurer may act on behalf of the State for
the purposes of giving a guarantee under this section or entering into an
agreement under this section. The Treasurer (or a person appointed by the
Treasurer) may execute any relevant document relating to the guarantee or
agreement.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bbfc9f2b-d291-4878-b22d-a24719ce2e9f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_14544594-406d-40f4-a2b3-c676c1b717ec"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Undertakings</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c0a3ce07-44c2-4bda-941b-8a4d40b8075c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The State may undertake to reimburse the
Commission, in circumstances specified or described in the undertaking, for
present or future liabilities incurred by the Commission to the Company under
the Agreement and arising from external events. Such a liability may relate to
increases in costs or to any other matters.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0ee1b7bb-66bc-403c-bcf1-ee77c1f4a7ae"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The form of such an undertaking (including its
terms and conditions) is to be as determined by the
Treasurer.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6e002570-c94f-4142-a701-fceeba31804f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The State may enter into agreements in connection
with such an undertaking, and may, in relation to any matters arising under or
in connection with the Agreement, agree to make a payment pursuant to such an
undertaking even though the Commission has acted in accordance with law or has
been constrained or otherwise affected by the operation of
law.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_688b572d-3f36-46ec-9169-a0c1e3cc2475"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Treasurer may act on behalf of the State for
the purposes of giving an undertaking under this section or entering into an
agreement under this section. The Treasurer (or a person appointed by the
Treasurer) may execute any relevant document relating to the undertaking or
agreement.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1ebce374-3de3-44ef-80f8-d32a1be31c0c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this section prevents the State from
giving undertakings, or entering into agreements, in relation to other
matters.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8e059349-578d-48f0-8cb1-15616e5ef7f6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 4</b></no><heading guid="_e0686e6f-a025-4a62-a36b-9244ffa3e35c"
id="pt.4-he"><b>Miscellaneous</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_84a7bee9-fb36-4fd8-a996-efd710b91674"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>11</no><heading guid="_c4bc74dd-8ce6-4edb-929f-9b4bf6072bdd"
id="sec.11-he"><b>Provisions applying if Commission is dissolved or its
functions are transferred</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.11-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_85bdd6ff-a752-422e-ba06-9f0136813818"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If the Commission is dissolved, the obligations
and liabilities of the Commission under the Agreement, including obligations
and liabilities relating to the supply of timber to the Company, become the
obligations and liabilities of:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1974f22d-b4a6-454e-a5d4-09c2eb255562" id="sec.11-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the State or an agency of the State specified by
the Minister by order published in the Gazette, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1f525e58-4ca8-4c56-838a-9681158f20a0" id="sec.11-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">(with the consent of the Company) another body or
person so specified.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.11-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_36a60ca4-3efd-4ee5-8f26-0c9c8984a3b5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If any of the functions of the Commission
affecting the obligations and liabilities of the Commission under the
Agreement, including obligations and liabilities relating to the supply of
timber to the Company, are transferred to or devolve on another body or
person, those obligations and liabilities become the obligations and
liabilities of:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_13d72024-2e57-41b1-953f-e0bd0dace7d4" id="sec.11-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the State or an agency of the State specified by
the Minister by order published in the Gazette, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_683392e5-1880-4391-ba51-d0846d22e385" id="sec.11-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">(with the consent of the Company) another body or
person so specified.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.12">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f063c9da-5578-416e-9c50-d0da731bb314"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>12</no><heading guid="_a732c834-9800-42aa-aea9-4023a372e63e"
id="sec.12-he"><b>Legal rights not affected</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in section 4:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5f1e6f6d-ae1d-4f58-a9ac-36d082ff16f1" id="sec.12-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">gives rise to any right or obligation enforceable
in a court of law or administrative review body, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_21e350b4-71c2-4cf6-a0d8-5c531b932934" id="sec.12-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">can be taken into account in any civil
proceedings (including, without limitation, administrative review
proceedings).</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.13">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bc4e13a5-5aac-4d08-9656-23353ad74c41"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>13</no><heading guid="_4b5467b2-a273-4211-81a9-137761b1918b"
id="sec.13-he"><b>Consent authority</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_dff45b72-7be7-41b8-a8ef-8682b819d6ba"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Despite anything in the <legref
refid="act-1979-203" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Environmental Planning and Assessment Act
1979</i></name></legref> or an environmental planning instrument under that
Act, the Minister is the consent authority for development (as defined in that
Act) connected with any of the designated activities.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_eef43a77-c380-49e1-803b-babac182223f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subsection (1) ceases to have effect on a day to
be appointed by the Minister by order published in the
Gazette.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.14">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d8f677d0-d9a4-4791-b86f-99f31dd0af36"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>14</no><heading guid="_950da32c-e598-48fd-83a5-ddc5d129223e"
id="sec.14-he"><b>Application of amending Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_44339b38-3df1-430f-accb-85853b92e094"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_fd83dc75-105d-481f-9832-11695c540138"
id="sec.14-def.amendingAct"><b><i>amending Act</i></b></defterm> means the
Act, if enacted, resulting from the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="bill"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Environmental Planning and Assessment
Amendment Bill 1997</i></name></legref> introduced into the Legislative
Assembly on 15 October 1997, and includes any amendments made to that Bill
before enactment, and also includes any amendments made to that Act after
enactment.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_113b1caf-f20a-4d28-a9bb-d24c267dc60a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The regulations may declare that any specified
uncommenced provisions of the amending Act apply to and in respect of any of
the designated activities.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_555d2be5-75b7-4fa4-bfd5-fcf7c7600b56"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The provisions apply accordingly, and so apply
with any necessary adaptations and with any adaptations specified in the
regulations.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.14-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f0b5317f-1ca7-4615-ad55-2b89d307667c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subsections (1)&#8211;(3) cease to have effect on
a day to be appointed by the Minister by order published in the
Gazette.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.15" status="repealed">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5749f563-00f7-4935-b2cc-2a00579931aa"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.15"></attrib>
<attrib name="status" value="repealed"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>15</no></head>
<repealed><repealedtxt></repealedtxt></repealed>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 15:</b> Rep 2002 No 53,
Sch 3.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.16">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5a188c23-3356-46c7-ac20-d2570d4af03b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>16</no><heading guid="_f9fb7d5a-1083-4e16-9d22-d8e211011435"
id="sec.16-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.16-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cb0f8db6-7d16-4375-845d-fe2641ef5c4d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations for the
purposes of section 14 and regulations that contain provisions of a savings or
transitional nature consequent on the making of an order under this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.16-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fdb4c522-fd6d-405b-b67e-737aa16d00d0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any such savings or transitional provision may,
if the regulations so provide, take effect from the date of assent to this Act
or a later date.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.16-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_27d5c418-1e67-4e75-bc1a-594e851d3d0e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.16-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">To the extent to which any such provision takes
effect from a date that is earlier than the date of its publication in the
Gazette, the provision does not operate so as:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_513edde1-f07a-426d-8a4b-2822d1c940fc" id="sec.16-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to affect, in a manner prejudicial to any person
(other than the State or an authority of the State), the rights of that person
existing before the date of its publication, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0c772d9c-977a-4c8a-aee9-385d4aa4dbdb" id="sec.16-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to impose liabilities on any person (other than
the State or an authority of the State) in respect of anything done or omitted
to be done before the date of its publication.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.17">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_adf5b465-93ef-43ef-8985-db2130e387da"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.17"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>17</no><heading guid="_af9c3fe5-8384-4ab3-9913-583883a337e3"
id="sec.17-he"><b>Review of Act</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.17-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2fa4948e-129f-4292-b678-ac76a14c42da"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.17-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister is to review this Act to determine
whether the policy objectives of the Act remain valid and whether the terms of
the Act remain appropriate for securing those
objectives.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.17-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_63b65c6d-0926-474a-af45-dd403a816ff8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.17-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The review is to be undertaken as soon as
possible after the period of 5 years from the date of assent to this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.17-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1059d4d5-4f72-4e1e-8bad-26125b1bf512"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.17-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A report on the outcome of the review is to be
tabled in each House of Parliament within 12 months after the end of the
period of 5 years.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>
</content>


