id="ed-he"><b>Historical notes</b></heading></head>

<level type="tableleg">
<head><heading guid="_5befa431-6f58-4516-a4ac-9c0105618e9a"
id="ed-he-oc.2"><b>Table of amending instruments</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1"><legref refid="act-1997-139" jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Visy Mill Facilitation Act
1997</i></name> No 139</legref>. Assented to 17.12.1997. Date of commencement
(sec 15 and Sch 1 excepted), 3.7.1998, sec 2 and GG No 102 of 3.7.1998, p
5211; sec 15 and Sch 1 were not commenced and were repealed by the <legref
refid="act-2002-053" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Statute Law (Miscellaneous Provisions) Act 2002</i></name>
No 53</legref>. This Act has been amended as follows:</txt>

<table frame="none" orient="port" heading.align="left" font.size="12.pt"
